5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I keep seeing invoices for things we didn't budget for. Let's check the hidden costs first.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to know who is actually available to work before we promise anything to the public.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The room is empty if no one walks in. I want to see the head counts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The floor has limits. I need to know what the structure can actually hold.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the door. Let's see where past deliveries actually failed, not just the plan.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria Staffing is vital, but if the money vanishes into repairs, we can't pay them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio If the money is there but no one is left to do the job, it is wasted.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,@Mio Money is a number. People are the proof. I stand by the head counts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,@Shion People break things. I need to know the weight limits before we invite them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka If the crate never arrives, the weight limit is irrelevant. I choose the paperwork.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the mount-making charges. That is where the budget usually bleeds out.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I will check the conservation lab staffing. I need to see the real capacity, not the ideal.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I will pull the weekend head counts. I want to see the trend, not the average.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will review the structural survey. I need the numbers on the suspended bay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the lender paperwork. I want to see the cut-offs that bite us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Let's see what the numbers say. I hope they are kind to us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the staff list is not a ghost. I need to know who is standing in the room.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I am ready. Let's see if the crowd is still there, or if they have moved on.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. The building does not lie. It just waits for us to listen.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am ready. I just want to know if the box will fit through the door.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
