35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The joiner's rate is up, and bespoke mounts are expensive. I want to avoid paying for things we can't move.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is one person. Two hundred pieces are waiting. We cannot promise a full season of care.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The numbers are clear. The crowd follows the motion. If the room is still, they leave.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. The last stone needed shoring. We cannot promise heavy things.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The paperwork is the trap. Two seasons we lost because the forms arrived late. I want to avoid that.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria If the lab is one person, we cannot promise a full season of care. I agree.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,@Mio Exactly. We are planning for a team that no longer exists. I need to know who is standing in the room.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka Heavy things are dead things. The crowd wants to see something move, or someone talk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion Motion is fine, but if the floor cracks, the motion stops. I need to know the weight.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio I agree. If the crate is late, the mount is useless. I want to avoid the shipping risk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I am leaning toward something that does not need a new mount. I want to save the joiner's money.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning toward something that does not need the lab. I want to save the one person we have.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,I am leaning toward something that has a person in it. I want to see the crowd come back.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning toward something that is light. I want to keep the bay safe.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning toward something that is local. I want to keep the door open.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,Let's see what is on the table. I hope it is light and cheap.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see what is on the table. I hope it is quiet and small.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see what is on the table. I hope it is alive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see what is on the table. I hope it is safe.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's see what is on the table. I hope it is here.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
