60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is local. No shipping, no new mounts. The craftspeople bring their own tools. This saves the joiner's money.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A needs no lab. The textiles are stable. The craftspeople are the staff. This saves the one person we have.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A has people. The craftspeople are in the room. The crowd will come back to see them work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is light. The garments and tools are small. The bay is safe. The floor is safe.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A is local. No paperwork. No cut-offs. The door is open. The box is here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,@Victoria I agree. Option A is the only one that does not bleed the budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,@Mio I agree. Option A is the only one that does not break the staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka Option B is heavy. The rigging is dangerous. The crowd wants people, not lights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,@Shion Option B is a risk. The overhead rigging is a weight. The bay is capped.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,@Mio Option C is a trap. The loans are distant. The paperwork is late. The door is closed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,Option D is a risk. The conservation bench is a lab. The one person is not enough.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Option D is a risk. The finds need cleaning. The backlog is two hundred pieces. We cannot promise care.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,Option D is quiet. The finds are dead. The crowd wants to see someone talk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Option D is heavy. The reconstructions are stone. The bay is capped. The floor is safe.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"Option D is a risk. The finds are local, but the bench is a lab. The door is open, but the staff is not.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I vote for A. It is light, cheap, and alive.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I vote for A. It is quiet, small, and staffed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,I vote for A. It is alive. The crowd will come.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for A. It is safe. The bay is safe.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I vote for A. It is here. The door is open.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
